        "official_en_sha256": "75592280825facc622f64fb8e9a05c8703bf55b1e29873d1cb9b3482ea9f5cbf"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "この世界で飛空艇を初めて作った人。\r\nそれが初代シド。数百年前の偉人よ。",
        "official_en": "A great man who built the first airship ever a few centuries ago.",
        "real_en": "The first person in this world to build an airship—that was the first Cid. He was a great man who lived centuries ago."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
