      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "それからシドという名前は\r\n最高の飛空艇技師に与えられる称号になって、\r\n今も受け継がれてるの。",
        "official_en": "Oh yeah, for sure! And the name “Cid” is now bestowed upon the greatest airship engineers of each era.",
        "real_en": "Since then, “Cid” has become a title bestowed on the greatest airship engineer, passed down to this day."
